--------------------------------------------
   Description of Example Structure Files
--------------------------------------------

1IA1-lig.pdb    : ligand structure in PDB:1IA1
1IA1-bs.pdb     : binding site structure for ligand 1IA1-lig.pdb

2BL9-lig.pdb    : ligand structure in PDB:2BL9
2BL9-bs.pdb     : binding site structure for ligand 2BL9-lig.pdb

3SRQ-lig.pdb    : ligand structure in PDB:3SRQ
3SRQ-bs.pdb     : binding site structure for ligand 3SRQ-lig.pdb

1NEZ_H.pdb      : protein chain H of PDB:1NEZ
1NEZ-surface.pdb: protein binding surface on 1NEZ_H.pdb

2ATP_C.pdb      : protein chain C of PDB:2ATP
2ATP-surface.pdb: protein binding surface on 2ATP_C.pdb